# ::tok Yangzi Evening News ( Reporter Ma Zuobo ) Yangzi Evening News / Zi Niu News reporter discovered in an interview on the 10th that the " price guarantee agreement " that has not been seen for more than ten years has returned to the Nanjing real estate market . A real estate project located in the Jiangbei New District claims " price difference compensation " . If the discounts of other properties before the delivery are greater than the previous discounts , the developer is willing to change the house for the buyer and refund the difference .
