# ::tok The large Hong Kong delegation of 100 people includes leaders of the Hong Kong government 's tourism - related departments , more than 60 representatives from travel agencies and cross - border transportation operators in Hong Kong and Macau , and about 30 representatives from tourism magazines and newspapers , social media , online media , bloggers / influencers , etc. They visited Macau to understand the latest tourism resources in Macau . The Hong Kong industry and media will bring new ways to play in Macau to Hong Kong residents and tourists visiting Hong Kong , and expand the " Hong Kong - Macau Joint Tour " market with the advantage of Hong Kong 's transportation hub .
