# ::tok He stated that it is necessary to deeply study and implement the spirit of General Secretary Xi Jinping 's important speech at the opening ceremony of the seminar , to firmly support the " two establishments " , to resolutely achieve the " two maintenances " , to enhance capabilities , to work hard , to solidly promote the work of modernization with Chinese characteristics , and to create achievements that can withstand the test of history , practice , and the people in the comprehensive construction of a modern socialist country and the comprehensive promotion of the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation .
