# ::tok Because everyone will consider , I spent so much money , I have to send someone to manage it , right ? This is a behavior that is usually done " , but Zheng Yonggang is different . On the day Shanshan successfully acquired , Zheng Yonggang publicly announced at Shangjin Optoelectronics that Shanshan , as the major shareholder of Shangjin , decided to implement a one - enterprise - two - systems policy . Except for Zheng Yonggang serving as the chairman , Shanshan 's people will not be sent to Shangjin . They will adopt an authorized operation method , and the original distribution system , corporate culture , and various management modes will remain unchanged .
