# ::tok The Full - Time series ' depiction of characters and emotional lines is very impressive . Some characters are only occasionally mentioned , but they leave a deep impression . Characters like Ye Xiu , Huang Shaotian , and Su Mucheng , who are more focused on , have a lot of fans , and characters not at the center of the writing like Jiang Botao and Chu Yunxiu are also very likable . In a refreshing e - sports novel , it 's surprising that there is n't a character that is extremely annoying . This is a success of Full - Time in character depiction .
