# ::tok I think , this collection of short stories , and its title , is like a kind of performance art . What the author wants to express is that love is not only the joys and sorrows on the stage , the eternal love in urban legends , nor just the inseparable intimacy between you and me . Love is not only the above but should not be represented by the above . Love is also a plain life like water , a boring day after day , and there is also a sense of helplessness in life , the escape from reality , and the confusion about the future .
