# ::tok I bought a total of 5 pick - up vouchers . When I went to pick them up , I made an appointment to pick up 3 for the first time , but only 2 were sent . After multiple communications , it was confirmed that one was missed and promised to be sent later . The second appointment happened to be on a rest day . Both the website and WeChat did not indicate that appointments need to be made on working days , causing unnecessary panic . I suggest improvements for the future .
