# ::tok Because the reviews said it was very good , I had high expectations for this pot . When I received it , I really liked it because it was lightweight . However , I found a problem when I started to use it . The bottom of the pot is not flat , it bulges in the middle and sinks around the edges , causing the oil to run to the sides . The large fatty meat I specifically bought to season the pot produced a lot of oil , but it could n't cover the central area and got burnt . I could n't even season the pot properly , let alone cook normally with this design .
